AI-Powered User Feedback Automation

An n8n automation workflow that automatically processes user feedback submitted through a form, uses Google Gemini AI to analyze and categorize the feedback, stores the results in Airtable, and sends notifications through Slack and Gmail.

🚀 Overview

This workflow automates the process of handling incoming user feedback.

When a user submits feedback through a form, the workflow:

Receives the feedback.
Sends the feedback to an AI Agent.
Uses Google Gemini to analyze and categorize the feedback.
Merges the original submission with the AI-generated result.
Routes the feedback based on its category.
Stores the categorized feedback in Airtable.
Sends notifications to the appropriate communication channels.
