Add urgency levels such as:
Low
Medium
High
Critical

🎯 Project Goal

The goal of this project is to demonstrate how AI agents and workflow automation can be combined to automate real-world user feedback management.

Instead of manually reading, categorizing, and forwarding feedback, the workflow automatically processes submissions and routes them to the appropriate destination.

